{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测下载FortiGate配置文件。对应需求：数据收集。官方：FortiGate Configuration File Downloaded。","from":"now-9m","interval":"5m","index":["logs-fortinet_fortigate.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】下载FortiGate配置文件","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n下载FortiGate配置文件\n\n### 为何重要\n收集邮箱、屏幕或敏感文件\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-26-060","https://www.fortinet.com/blog/psirt-blogs/analysis-of-sso-abuse-on-fortios","https://www.elastic.co/docs/reference/integrations/fortinet_fortigate","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2026/01/28/fortinet-releases-guidance-address-ongoing-exploitation-authentication-bypass-vulnerability-cve-2026"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"b7e2a04d-4f8a-4e12-8c9a-1d5e6f7a8b9c","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 数据收集","来源: 默认","对应需求: 数据收集"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"any where data_stream.dataset == \"fortinet_fortigate.log\" and\n    event.code == \"0100032095\" and\n    fortinet.firewall.action == \"download\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1602","name":"Data from Configuration Repository","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1602/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1602.002","name":"Network Device Configuration Dump","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1602/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1552","name":"Unsecured Credentials","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1552.001","name":"Credentials In Files","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitr